00:24:22.118 --> 00:24:24.253
I'm not judging you if you're
watching "House of Cards"

00:24:24.253 --> 00:24:25.821
and playing Madden all day.

00:24:25.821 --> 00:24:27.556
I'm judging you 
if you're complaining

00:24:27.556 --> 00:24:29.825
