00:24:31.928 --> 00:24:32.828
Got it?

00:24:32.828 --> 00:24:34.196
That's the distinction.

00:24:34.196 --> 00:24:35.131
Do you!

00:24:35.131 --> 00:24:36.565
Do you know how many 
people are very happy

00:24:36.565 --> 00:24:39.168
