surfing every weekend?

00:24:39.168 --> 00:24:41.137
Making $200,000 a year?

00:24:41.137 --> 00:24:42.138
I'm not judging.

00:24:42.138 --> 00:24:44.607
Who the fuck am I to judge you?

00:24:44.607 --> 00:24:47.777
I'm judging the people that
email me every day saying,

00:24:47.777 --> 00:24:51.814
"My shit's not working. 
I'm not lucky, I don't get it."

00:24:51.814 --> 00:24:55.164
And then are watching full
seasons of "House of Cards,"

00:24:55.164 --> 00:24:56.655
playing Madden all day,

00:24:56.655 --> 00:24:58.457
taking the entire weekend off.

00:24:58.457 --> 00:25:00.392
I didn't take any 
of my weekends off

00:25:00.392 --> 00:25:02.828
for the first 
15 years of my career.

00:25:04.844 --> 00:25:05.507
Just so you know,

00:25:05.507 --> 00:25:08.507
all of the venom is 
for the complainers.

00:25:08.507 --> 00:25:09.708
You're good?

00:25:09.708 --> 00:25:11.090
You won.

00:25:11.090 --> 00:25:12.558
- How do you stay, 
though, with the curve?

00:25:12.558 --> 00:25:13.859
How much time?

00:25:13.859 --> 00:25:15.060
Number one, I think this is

00:25:15.060 --> 00:25:16.028
