00:25:21.734 --> 00:25:22.568
- Every day.

00:25:22.568 --> 00:25:23.539
- [Aaron] Did you do it today?
- Yep.

00:25:23.539 --> 00:25:24.223
- [Aaron] See 
anything interesting?

00:25:24.223 --> 00:25:25.158
- Nope.

00:25:25.158 --> 00:25:26.502
(audience laughs)

00:25:26.502 --> 00:25:28.604
I only see something interesting
once or twice a year.

00:25:28.604 --> 00:25:29.472
That's the point.

00:25:29.472 --> 00:25:30.940
