00:25:40.939 --> 00:25:41.774
Audit.

00:25:41.774 --> 00:25:43.709
All in, all fucking chips in.

00:25:43.709 --> 00:25:44.910
Audit, audit!

00:25:44.910 --> 00:25:46.545
- [Aaron] Made any 
VR investments yet?

00:25:46.545 --> 00:25:48.247
- No, but one's brewing.

