00:26:09.168 --> 00:26:10.002
What do you think?

00:26:10.002 --> 00:26:11.203
- I don't think 
it's going to happen.

00:26:11.203 --> 00:26:12.171
- [Aaron] I hope 
he's not here yet.

00:26:12.171 --> 00:26:13.339
(audience laughs)

00:26:13.339 --> 00:26:15.494
