here is going to watch

00:26:21.066 --> 00:26:22.835
the Devils' game 
next year on VR?

00:26:22.835 --> 00:26:23.669
I do not.

00:26:23.669 --> 00:26:24.503
- [Aaron] What do you 
think they'll do?

00:26:24.503 --> 00:26:25.337
- When I say everybody,

00:26:25.337 --> 00:26:27.539
this is an early 
user crowd, right?

00:26:27.539 --> 00:26:28.607
You're at Propeller.

00:26:28.607 --> 00:26:31.143
I don't think a good
percentage of you will do it.

00:26:31.143 --> 00:26:32.578
I definitely don't 
think a good percentage

00:26:32.578 --> 00:26:34.680
