00:26:35.547 --> 00:26:36.782
That's when I care.

00:26:36.782 --> 00:26:40.085
I care when Ricky Thompson
knows about Snapchat.

00:26:40.085 --> 00:26:42.721
I care when Sally Arkansas
cares about Snapchat.

00:26:42.721 --> 00:26:44.890
Not when Nerdy
fucking McGee is on it.

00:26:44.890 --> 00:26:47.693
(audience laughs)

00:26:47.693 --> 00:26:48.827
