00:26:48.827 --> 00:26:50.496
Nerd, where are you?

00:26:52.344 --> 00:26:53.846
What do you think is
the number one use case?

00:26:53.846 --> 00:26:55.080
I bring this up 
because I think--

00:26:55.080 --> 00:26:56.815
- Oh, it's going to take, 
by the way,

00:26:56.815 --> 00:27:00.149
VR is the only potential
arbitrage to the internet.

00:27:00.149 --> 00:27:01.417
