00:27:13.696 --> 00:27:16.665
- I can't fucking 
wait for VR porn.

00:27:16.665 --> 00:27:18.901
- Would you invest in that?

00:27:19.889 --> 00:27:21.423
- Maybe.

00:27:21.423 --> 00:27:23.826
- Just to get the free headset?

00:27:23.826 --> 00:27:24.894
- Yeah.

00:27:24.894 --> 00:27:26.996
(audience laughs)

00:27:26.996 --> 00:27:30.832
I just think even porn is
further away than people,

00:27:30.832 --> 00:27:34.253
look, consumer behavior is
underestimated.

00:27:34.253 --> 00:27:38.423
Guys, only 20% of products
are bought in e-commerce.

00:27:39.391 --> 00:27:41.570
We're still buying in stores.

00:27:41.570 --> 00:27:45.661
In 1996 when I started
WineLibrary.com, 1997,

00:27:45.661 --> 00:27:49.327
if you told me that in 2016

