only 20% would be e-com

00:27:51.437 --> 00:27:52.441
I would've made fun of you.

00:27:52.441 --> 00:27:53.438
You don't see the future.

00:27:53.438 --> 00:27:54.396
You don't get it.

00:27:54.396 --> 00:27:56.705
It takes time for 
behavior to change.

00:27:56.705 --> 00:27:59.061
For you to sit at 
home and live your lives

00:27:59.061 --> 00:28:00.045
through that world,

00:28:00.045 --> 00:28:01.747
or spend a meaningful 
amount of time will take time.

00:28:01.747 --> 00:28:03.448
I actually believe 
it will happen.

00:28:03.448 --> 00:28:04.883
But I think it's 
going to be a hell,

00:28:04.883 --> 00:28:08.277
I think headsets will
never be at scale, ever.

00:28:08.277 --> 00:28:11.557
Meaning, by the time it's at
scale we'll be on contacts

00:28:11.557 --> 00:28:12.785
or some other version.

00:28:12.785 --> 00:28:15.661
I don't think we'll ever
have mass headsets

00:28:15.661 --> 00:28:16.985
at home doing VR.

00:28:16.985 --> 00:28:19.455
Mass, mass, like everybody.

00:28:19.455 --> 00:28:22.501
Maybe, but I just don't see it.

00:28:22.501 --> 00:28:23.812
It's going to take too long

00:28:23.812 --> 00:28:26.305
and there'll be
advancements on the headsets.

00:28:26.305 --> 00:28:26.999
I've got to go, right?

00:28:26.999 --> 00:28:28.240
- Yeah, we do, 
hold on one second.

00:28:28.240 --> 00:28:29.074
- Okay.

00:28:29.074 --> 00:28:31.643
- The ethos of the 
New Jersey tech meetup

00:28:31.643 --> 00:28:33.692
and the ethos of this event is
about helping each other out.

00:28:33.692 --> 00:28:34.600
- Great!

00:28:34.600 --> 00:28:35.814
- What can we do?

00:28:35.814 --> 00:28:38.567
What can people here do
today to help you out?

00:28:38.567 --> 00:28:39.441
- Nothing.

00:28:39.441 --> 00:28:40.275
- That's not true.

00:28:40.275 --> 00:28:42.878
You can't leave here until
you think of something.

00:28:42.878 --> 00:28:44.146
- Zero.

00:28:44.146 --> 00:28:45.781
I'm super uncomfortable 
with the ask.

00:28:45.781 --> 00:28:47.816
I don't want anything 
from you right now,

00:28:47.816 --> 00:28:48.984
and that makes me happier

00:28:48.984 --> 00:28:50.486
than coming up 
with some bullshit ask.

00:28:50.486 --> 00:28:52.254
- What can they do for
themselves that you believe in,

00:28:52.254 --> 00:28:54.723
wholeheartedly, that
will make you feel good?

00:28:54.723 --> 00:28:56.191
- Do something nice 
for somebody else

00:28:56.191 --> 00:28:58.460
that brings them value
without having expectations

00:28:58.460 --> 00:28:59.795
of something in return.

00:28:59.795 --> 00:29:01.864
Which is something 
most of you can't do.

00:29:01.864 --> 00:29:03.465
(audience claps)

00:29:03.465 --> 00:29:06.168
- Ladies and gentlemen, 
Gary Vaynerchuk.

00:29:06.168 --> 00:29:07.002
- Thank you, guys.

00:29:07.002 --> 00:29:07.836
- Hold on, buddy.

00:29:07.836 --> 00:29:08.637
- Thank you, guys.

00:29:08.637 --> 00:29:09.471
- Look up here.

00:29:09.471 --> 00:29:10.706
- Much love.

00:29:10.706 --> 00:29:12.040
Smile, hands up!

00:29:13.919 --> 00:29:17.189
(beaming music)

